{"4692920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Mouth must Eat", "steam_appid": 4692920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE THE FOOD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a closed environment with a creature that is always hungry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this co-op survival horror, up to 4 players, you must search for resources, feed the monster, and survive each night. <br>But feeding it doesn’t stop it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It only buys you time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE EACH NIGHT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map and search for items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the creature to delay its aggression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set traps and try to outsmart it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape, hide, or sacrifice others to survive</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night gets harder.<br>Every mistake gets punished.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP OR DIE ALONE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate… or panic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split roles or stick together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave someone behind if you have to</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival is easier together.<br>Trust is optional.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN OR DIE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorize the map and item locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to changing conditions each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React to unpredictable creature behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions under pressure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you know, the longer you last.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE CREATURE EVOLVES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you survive, the worse it gets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monster mutates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It becomes faster, smarter, more aggressive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It reacts to your actions… and your mistakes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not in control.<br>You are being hunted.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op survival horror (up to 4 players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense, replayable runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic difficulty and evolving enemy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, dark environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High tension, high risk gameplay</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE THE FOOD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a closed environment with a creature that is always hungry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this co-op survival horror, up to 4 players, you must search for resources, feed the monster, and survive each night. <br>But feeding it doesn’t stop it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It only buys you time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE EACH NIGHT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map and search for items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the creature to delay its aggression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set traps and try to outsmart it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape, hide, or sacrifice others to survive</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night gets harder.<br>Every mistake gets punished.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP OR DIE ALONE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate… or panic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split roles or stick together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave someone behind if you have to</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival is easier together.<br>Trust is optional.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN OR DIE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorize the map and item locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to changing conditions each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React to unpredictable creature behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions under pressure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you know, the longer you last.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE CREATURE EVOLVES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you survive, the worse it gets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monster mutates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It becomes faster, smarter, more aggressive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It reacts to your actions… and your mistakes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not in control.<br>You are being hunted.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op survival horror (up to 4 players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense, replayable runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic difficulty and evolving enemy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, dark environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High tension, high risk gameplay</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "You are not the hunter. You are the food. Survive the night in this co-op survival horror where feeding the monster is your only chance to stay alive.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4692920/31098f6e6d5ed3882ed28bf14961e84ba51ea769/header.jpg?t=1778661259", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4692920/5b5af206a34cc8bae552ac06ddad9608e4bbd196/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778661259", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.